  "sections": [
    {
      "label": "Verse 1",
      "kind": "verse",
      "color_hex": "#2378C3",
      "hotkey": "1",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Come, Thou Fount of every blessing, tune my heart to sing Thy grace;",
          "chords": [
            {
              "position": 0,
              "text": "D"
            },
            {
              "position": 20,
              "text": "A"
            },
            {
              "position": 36,
              "text": "G"
            },
            {
              "position": 44,
              "text": "A"
            },
            {
              "position": 62,
              "text": "D"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Streams of mercy, never ceasing, call for songs of loudest praise.",
          "chords": [
            {
              "position": 0,
              "text": "D"
            },
            {
              "position": 18,
              "text": "A"
            },
            {
              "position": 33,
              "text": "G"
            },
            {
              "position": 42,
              "text": "A"
            },
            {
              "position": 59,
              "text": "D"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Teach me some melodious sonnet, sung by flaming tongues above;",
          "chords": [
            {
              "position": 0,
              "text": "Bm"
            },
            {
              "position": 16,
              "text": "G"
            },
            {
              "position": 32,
              "text": "Bm"
            },
            {
              "position": 40,
              "text": "G"
            },
            {
              "position": 57,
              "text": "D"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Praise the mount! I’m fixed upon it, mount of God’s unchanging love.",
          "chords": [
            {
              "position": 0,
              "text": "D"
            },
            {
              "position": 22,
              "text": "A"
            },
            {
              "position": 37,
              "text": "G"
            },
            {
              "position": 46,
              "text": "A"
            },
            {
              "position": 63,
              "text": "D"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "Verse 2",
      "kind": "verse",
      "color_hex": "#2378C3",
      "hotkey": "2",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Here I raise my Ebenezer; hither by Thy help I’m come;",
          "chords": [
            {
              "position": 0,
              "text": "D"
            },
            {
              "position": 16,
              "text": "A"
            },
            {
              "position": 26,
              "text": "G"
            },
            {
              "position": 33,
              "text": "A"
            },
            {
              "position": 49,
              "text": "D"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I hope, by Thy good pleasure, safely to arrive at home.",
          "chords": [
            {
              "position": 0,
              "text": "D"
            },
            {
              "position": 15,
              "text": "A"
            },
            {
              "position": 34,
              "text": "G"
            },
            {
              "position": 41,
              "text": "A"
            },
            {
              "position": 54,
              "text": "D"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus sought me when a stranger, wandering from the fold of God;",
          "chords": [
            {
              "position": 0,
              "text": "Bm"
            },
            {
              "position": 16,
              "text": "G"
            },
            {
              "position": 33,
              "text": "Bm"
            },
            {
              "position": 43,
              "text": "G"
            },
            {
              "position": 60,
              "text": "D"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He, to rescue me from danger, interposed His precious blood.",
          "chords": [
            {
              "position": 0,
              "text": "D"
            },
            {
              "position": 14,
              "text": "A"
            },
            {
              "position": 30,
              "text": "G"
            },
            {
              "position": 35,
              "text": "A"
            },
            {
              "position": 54,
              "text": "D"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "Verse 3",
      "kind": "verse",
      "color_hex": "#2378C3",
      "hotkey": "3",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "O to grace how great a debtor daily I’m constrained to be!",
          "chords": [
            {
              "position": 0,
              "text": "D"
            },
            {
              "position": 15,
              "text": "A"
            },
            {
              "position": 30,
              "text": "G"
            },
            {
              "position": 36,
              "text": "A"
            },
            {
              "position": 55,
              "text": "D"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let Thy goodness, like a fetter, bind my wandering heart to Thee.",
          "chords": [
            {
              "position": 0,
              "text": "D"
            },
            {
              "position": 18,
              "text": "A"
            },
            {
              "position": 33,
              "text": "G"
            },
            {
              "position": 41,
              "text": "A"
            },
            {
              "position": 60,
              "text": "D"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Prone to wander, Lord, I feel it, prone to leave the God I love;",
          "chords": [
            {
              "position": 0,
              "text": "Bm"
            },
            {
              "position": 17,
              "text": "G"
            },
            {
              "position": 34,
              "text": "Bm"
            },
            {
              "position": 43,
              "text": "G"
            },
            {
              "position": 59,
              "text": "D"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Here’s my heart, O take and seal it, seal it for Thy courts above.",
          "chords": [
            {
              "position": 0,
              "text": "D"
            },
            {
              "position": 19,
              "text": "A"
            },
            {
              "position": 37,
              "text": "G"
            },
            {
              "position": 45,
              "text": "A"
            },
            {
              "position": 61,
              "text": "D"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
